{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c1008a7ae40b062c6732ee59f509e61caca2bf8b8d0794040064d1cee22fb1e", "ja": "（スポーツパークの目玉イベント『100人で踊ろう』\n企画は大成功！　さて、あとは撤収作業だ……）", "zh": "（运动公园的重点活动『百人共舞』企划非常成功！\n好，接着就是撤场了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "baeb5789d442e5a918d3ed54e0297da96b8bdbcc7a14174948fdf1e3f859fc70", "ja": "{$P$}、おつかれさまでしたー！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "40d4b2c11390d9931c62ec2e5d805324bc52617ef6b7f65a6a10ddbf0d28ea24", "ja": "お疲れさま、やよい。\nお客さん達も、かなり盛り上がっていたな！", "zh": "辛苦你了，弥生。\n观众的气氛也非常热烈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "111ea5122e4cd3f79d687b913bea6c0988ef0fd9decee645731312e9fcbed00a", "ja": "はい！　みんな一緒に踊ってくれて、\nとーっても楽しかったです！", "zh": "嗯！大家都一起跳起了舞，\n实在非～常开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2a1c8eb03d1d65b61a1156379ac6c84bfb4435e5ca4d19d63e1bb037fad0e15a", "ja": "たくさんの人たちが、やよいの振り付けを\n熱心に真似していて、すごい熱気を感じたよ。", "zh": "有很多人认真模仿你的舞步，\n让人感觉非常热情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "a3957f35074f11e197bf197abc99a1a228fdb5c7750223eabfcf25292f94b116", "ja": "えへへっ、私もすっごく楽しかったですー。\nみんなと……えっと……イッタイカンを感じました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也非常开心喔～\n感觉跟大家……怎么说呢……充满了一体感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "114af15b3038e5f28ebc2bd74480e123b53b23eb5cccbfd1f204435bf05fe39d", "ja": "みんな一緒に汗びっしょりになったけど、\nそれも、なんだかうれしいなーって！", "zh": "虽然大家都变得满身大汗了，\n但就连这点都让我感觉很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a84b7dda7438c09d05131a17e44f16fa2f7550ee9d4ac502bd2e1fe72ff52e9d", "ja": "そうだよな、全力で汗をかいた後って、\n充実感があるというか、気持ちいいもんな。", "zh": "的确是呢，尽全力挥洒汗水后，\n会让人感觉很充实，身心舒畅对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b800e2526fdaf5c10e7aac75cc3cd470d14d1f832ed4955459a86c935c80f2a", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}も、\nいっぱい汗をかいたら、気持ちいいですよ！", "zh": "没错！{$P$}也是，\n尽情挥汗后，就会觉得很畅快喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac8576837c255f890e9fc53ea0269a502404872456a250493b12a797cc01f29b", "ja": "そうだなあ。\nたしかに、最近ずっと運動不足だからな……。", "zh": "说得也是，\n我确实最近一直缺乏运动啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "f39617ddd5cd839d5158413c72ec2673c2717d55f5561b716acfe3f811195bad", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}も、振り付けを\n覚えて、一緒に踊りましょー！　私、教えます！", "zh": "对了！{$P$}你也把舞步记起来，\n然后一起来跳吧──！我会教你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8675f23420a81d5bdcb50d26f30e5713c275e84b8cff7ddf7cee01c4a12d489d", "ja": "えっ、俺も？　うーん……これから撤収作業があるし、\n今はあんまり時間もないんだよな。", "zh": "咦，我也来？嗯……接下来要进行撤场，\n现在没什么时间呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "14033a8009b160805cbafd433106497b6e7718626c3d7530d6e7f1a289c89be2", "ja": "えっ……。そうですかー。", "zh": "咦……这样啊──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9cec3b6edf5e308d3e028d038469caa3a4287a9fbcc6d8e45ed63d78f672bada", "ja": "ごめんな。撤収の後なら時間も取れるんだけど、\nあんまり遅くなるのもまずいし。", "zh": "抱歉，虽然撤场结束后就有时间了，\n但拖到太晚也不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "1c20219c2400f28307e1641c490f4e905a59169a4960afa01dc9b920bc1ff2f0", "ja": "あ、大丈夫です！　それじゃあ、\nすぐに出来る運動を考えますから！", "zh": "啊，没关系的！\n那么我会想个能立刻进行的运动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "29ce9ebc4edb850cf38ac60fceb26fc8a7338806020c79a33e991d5a276cf0cc", "ja": "うーんと……あっ、パン食い競争！\n運動になるし、お腹もいっぱいになりますよね？", "zh": "我想想喔……啊，吃面包比赛！\n既能够运动，又能填饱肚子对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "940d3d678070a740fc454e3058ed4121e4d0fda00b235f536b4cec6a47d64fe1", "ja": "まあまあ準備に時間かかりそうだし、\nまずパンを買いにいかないと……。", "zh": "感觉要花上一阵子来准备，\n而且得先去买面包才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "83b76e6f51f7137cfc2fb55f010ea63d858887f2621f7a1d1d69008fb7f94c0c", "ja": "うう、そうですよね。\nえーっと、それなら……。うーっ。", "zh": "唔唔，说得也是呢。\n呃～这样的话……唔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "ba43f86a00a733e32c9096dc7f3b0b5a425d262db49a42f0e7d89aaf86591b1b", "ja": "あっ、キャッチボールはどうですか？　弟達と\nやってるから、私、けっこう得意なんですー！", "zh": "啊，传接球怎么样？\n因为平常会跟弟弟们玩，所以我挺擅长的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3663d397e801d08cf15bce46bf57b40baa7b34ece8f2d531f862660a892e0be8", "ja": "残念だけど、それもグラブとボールの\n用意が必要だな……。", "zh": "很遗憾，\n那也必须准备手套和球才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "664de800a834a6fbb2384b28cea469a051452e7c236803520f4eded7963ea809", "ja": "うう……、時間も道具もなくてもできること……。\n飛んだり走ったりとか……。", "zh": "唔唔……没时间跟道具也能做的运动……\n像是跳或是跑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "70797fe59c35065511b410fd32ef19a45cc1f2cd8da728f659ea6ca9a965ed7f", "ja": "あの、{$P$}！　今日はひとつ先の\n駅まで、ジョギングして帰りませんか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}！今天回去的时候，\n要不要先慢跑到下一个车站呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3ca4807ce20b71dea6a0178cb201085f4a2332ee463d10ade3b88495a35cd986", "ja": "なるほど、ジョギングか。\nたしかに、いい運動になりそうだ。", "zh": "原来如此，慢跑啊，\n感觉的确会是个不错的运动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "fd352998b84dc3d7326aab6f637c80d295150138369a21eeca300ab6925be2d3", "ja": "はいっ、交通費も節約できるし、オトクだなーって。\n元気だったら、もう一つ先まで行けますし！", "zh": "是呀，而且还能够节省交通费，我认为很划算喔。\n要是仍有余力，还能再跑到下一站呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1024_p", "source_sha256": "158eac9b10d8e4582c9b343115fa630cd19bf2aac39f9e8ecfc7abd29e949751", "ja": "よし、決まりだな！\nそれじゃ、とりあえず撤収を終わらせてくるよ。", "zh": "好，就这么决定了！\n那我先去完成撤场的工作啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "7f00fd7de73d711602b642626018a9bfa1b462e4ce77d24cc8d44c0253198f16", "ja": "はーい！　一緒にジョギング、頑張りましょー！\nえへへ、私、準備運動して待ってますねっ。", "zh": "好──！我们一起努力慢跑吧──！\n嘿嘿，我会做好热身运动等你的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "0d5617949b1d51fe1fe3e16b7680c4879593cb00a99c4ab09b787054693a5cc7", "ja": "いっち、にー、さん、し！\nごー、ろく、しち、はちっ！", "zh": "一、二、三、四！\n五、六、七、八！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0124_1027_p", "source_sha256": "566c0d3d34dbf2c3bf60ea352a9a378049cef33fe0ccd2eeb606ecd35416362f", "ja": "（やよいは、元気よく準備運動を始めた。……うん。\nやよいが疲れる前に、撤収を終わらせないとな！）", "zh": "（弥生很有精神地做起热身运动了……嗯，\n必须在她觉得累之前，赶紧完成撤场才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
